-learning and cultural links on the faculty's website.\n\nAddress: 50 Phelan Avenue, San Francisco, CA\n\nWebsite: ccsf.edu\n\nTel: (415) 452-5555\n\nColumbia University\n\nStudy French at the Department of French and Romance Philology at Columbia University. Established in 1890, Columbia's French faculty has continued to attract many of the top French and Francophone studies scholars from all over the world. Visit the department's website to find information on"
