ibutions to the field with a MacArthur Fellows Program \"genius\" award and the Edward Ullendorff Medal from the Council of the British Academy. He is Regents Professor Emeritus of Medieval Studies at Saint John's University, Collegeville, Minnesota, and Curator Emeritus of the Ethiopian Study Center at the Hill"
